Export the licence text

The archive ships its licence as LICENSE.txt, which the BUILD file leaves out
of its exported files, so no licence declaration can point at it.

The patch adds one line to the ruleset's BUILD file and carries the six
around it, too little of the file to attribute.

License: Apache-2.0 (hermeticbuild/rules_rust source-fd521efe16c03e4cd169453eb44fb98d73ebb7aa)

--- a/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/BUILD.bazel
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
     ".clippy.toml",
     ".rustfmt.toml",
     "LICENSE",
+    "LICENSE.txt",
     "MODULE.bazel",
     "version.bzl",
 ])
